{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "41718170",
      "title": "Introducing & Using Server Actions for Handling Form Submissions",
      "sourceHash": "894962bf89047d45bf8f4d92919f3feaea4fc9bd707dcb44e17727723a8ea8cc",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.42,
          "end": 3.09,
          "en": "So, now that we've got this form here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.09,
          "end": 4.71,
          "en": "and we're able to pick images,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.71,
          "end": 6.63,
          "en": "it's time to make sure that this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 6.63,
          "end": 9.93,
          "en": "can also be submitted, and that we then create",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.93,
          "end": 13.11,
          "en": "and store a new meal when that happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.11,
          "end": 16.29,
          "en": "Now when it comes to handling form submissions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.29,
          "end": 21.03,
          "en": "we could do that as we do it in most React projects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.03,
          "end": 24.27,
          "en": "We can go to the component that contains the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.27,
          "end": 27.18,
          "en": "and then we could add the onSubmit prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 27.18,
          "end": 28.98,
          "en": "and define a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.98,
          "end": 31.533,
          "en": "that should be executed when the form is submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.73,
          "end": 35.61,
          "en": "There, we could then prevent the browser default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.61,
          "end": 37.53,
          "en": "manually collect all the data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 37.53,
          "end": 40.44,
          "en": "and send that data to a backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.44,
          "end": 44.73,
          "en": "But again, here we already are on the backend,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.73,
          "end": 46.29,
          "en": "at least kind of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.29,
          "end": 48.42,
          "en": "We have a full stack application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.42,
          "end": 51.48,
          "en": "that has both backend and frontend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.48,
          "end": 54.12,
          "en": "And that's why Next.js gives us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.12,
          "end": 57.09,
          "en": "a more powerful and convenient pattern",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.09,
          "end": 60.09,
          "en": "than manually handling the form submission",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 60.09,
          "end": 63.153,
          "en": "and collecting the data and sending it to a server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 64.32,
          "end": 68.43,
          "en": "Instead, we can create a function in the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.43,
          "end": 70.623,
          "en": "that holds the form, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 71.55,
          "end": 74.49,
          "en": "which we could call shareMeal here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 74.49,
          "end": 75.963,
          "en": "though the name is up to you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.46000000000001,
          "end": 81.81,
          "en": "And we can then add a special directive in this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 81.81,
          "end": 85.11,
          "en": "so inside of this function body.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 85.11,
          "end": 87.963,
          "en": "And that's the 'use server' directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 89.52,
          "end": 92.91,
          "en": "Now, we have seen the 'use client' directive before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.91,
          "end": 96.33,
          "en": "which however was not added inside of functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.33,
          "end": 98.67,
          "en": "but inside of files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.67,
          "end": 102.75,
          "en": "And then when added there, 'use client' made sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 102.75,
          "end": 105.78,
          "en": "that the components created in that file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.78,
          "end": 107.613,
          "en": "would be client components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.14,
          "end": 113.16,
          "en": "'use server' inside of a function is different",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.16,
          "end": 117.93,
          "en": "because this creates a so-called Server Action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.93,
          "end": 120.51,
          "en": "which is a function that's guaranteed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 120.51,
          "end": 124.38,
          "en": "to execute on the server, and only there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 124.38,
          "end": 129.15,
          "en": "So just as components by default are server components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 129.15,
          "end": 131.61,
          "en": "which only execute on the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.61,
          "end": 133.41,
          "en": "this is now a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.41,
          "end": 136.11,
          "en": "that only executes on a server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.11,
          "end": 137.55,
          "en": "But in case of functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 137.55,
          "end": 141.39,
          "en": "you must explicitly state that it belongs to the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.39,
          "end": 143.79,
          "en": "by adding this directive inside of them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.79,
          "end": 146.643,
          "en": "if you wanna create such a Server Action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.69,
          "end": 150.15,
          "en": "In addition, to really turn this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 150.15,
          "end": 152.49,
          "en": "into a so-called Server Action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.49,
          "end": 156.32999999999998,
          "en": "you also must add the \"async\" keyword in front of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.32999999999998,
          "end": 158.88,
          "en": "And now this is a Server Action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.88,
          "end": 162.72,
          "en": "But what's now the special thing about this Server Action?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 162.72,
          "end": 164.583,
          "en": "Why does this feature exist?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.63,
          "end": 169.17000000000002,
          "en": "Well, this feature exists in React, by the way,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.17000000000002,
          "end": 172.82999999999998,
          "en": "not just in Next.js, but like server components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 172.82999999999998,
          "end": 175.98,
          "en": "it doesn't really work in Vanilla React apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 175.98,
          "end": 178.62,
          "en": "Instead, you need a framework like Next",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.62,
          "end": 181.44,
          "en": "to unlock this feature and use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.44,
          "end": 183.09,
          "en": "And this feature then exists",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.09,
          "end": 186.18,
          "en": "because you can now take such a Server Action",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.18,
          "end": 189.33,
          "en": "and assign this Server Action function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 189.33,
          "end": 193.203,
          "en": "as a value for the action prop on a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 194.1,
          "end": 196.65,
          "en": "So here, I'm setting shareMeal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 196.65,
          "end": 201.543,
          "en": "as a value on that action prop of that form here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.92000000000002,
          "end": 204.54,
          "en": "And that's of course something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 204.54,
          "end": 206.57999999999998,
          "en": "you might have never seen before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.57999999999998,
          "end": 209.13,
          "en": "because normally, the action prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.13,
          "end": 214.11,
          "en": "is set to the path to which the request should be sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.11,
          "end": 215.37,
          "en": "if you are relying",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 215.37,
          "end": 219.153,
          "en": "on the browser's built-in form handling capabilities.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 220.23,
          "end": 221.76,
          "en": "Now that's not what we're doing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.76,
          "end": 224.16,
          "en": "Instead, we're setting it to an action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 224.16,
          "end": 226.503,
          "en": "to such a Server Action function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 227.97,
          "end": 229.92000000000002,
          "en": "And that's a pattern that's supported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 229.92000000000002,
          "end": 233.13,
          "en": "by Next and React here that will ensure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.13,
          "end": 235.29,
          "en": "that when this form is submitted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 235.29,
          "end": 238.17000000000002,
          "en": "Next.js will, behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.17000000000002,
          "end": 242.07,
          "en": "create a request and send it to this Next.js server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 242.07,
          "end": 244.05,
          "en": "that's serving the website",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 244.05,
          "end": 246.36,
          "en": "so that this function gets triggered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 246.36,
          "end": 249.03,
          "en": "and you can then handle the form submission there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 249.03,
          "end": 250.95,
          "en": "but on the server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 250.95,
          "end": 253.71,
          "en": "So, that function will then execute on the server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 253.71,
          "end": 255.243,
          "en": "not in the client.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 256.41,
          "end": 259.71,
          "en": "And this function will then automatically receive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 259.71,
          "end": 263.13,
          "en": "that formData that was submitted.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 263.13,
          "end": 267.09,
          "en": "So, the data that was gathered by the inputs in the form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 267.09,
          "end": 270.21,
          "en": "collected in a formData object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 270.21,
          "end": 275.103,
          "en": "using that formData class that's available in JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 275.97,
          "end": 278.7,
          "en": "So we'll get such a formData object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 278.7,
          "end": 282.423,
          "en": "and we can then use that to handle the submitted data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 283.53,
          "end": 286,
          "en": "For example, here, we could create a meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 286.86,
          "end": 290.82,
          "en": "by extracting meal data from that form data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 290.82,
          "end": 295.17,
          "en": "So we could add a title property to this meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 295.17,
          "end": 300.17,
          "en": "and as a value store formData.get 'title'.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 301.32,
          "end": 303.72,
          "en": "This formData object that we're getting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 303.72,
          "end": 305.79,
          "en": "will have a get method that allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 305.79,
          "end": 307.83,
          "en": "to get the value that was entered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 307.83,
          "end": 309.63,
          "en": "into a certain input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 309.63,
          "end": 312.9,
          "en": "and the input field is identified by its name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 312.9,
          "end": 315.54,
          "en": "So, if I get the value of the input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 315.54,
          "end": 318.36,
          "en": "with the name 'title', I am getting the value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 318.36,
          "end": 320.67,
          "en": "of this input field here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 320.67,
          "end": 323.943,
          "en": "because this input field has that name, 'title'.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 327.598,
          "end": 329.13,
          "en": "And of course we can now do that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 329.13,
          "end": 331.62,
          "en": "for all the data that makes up a meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 331.62,
          "end": 334.5,
          "en": "So, all the data we're expecting in our database,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 334.5,
          "end": 337.509,
          "en": "like the image, the summary, the instructions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 337.509,
          "end": 339.933,
          "en": "creator, creator_email, and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 341.37,
          "end": 345.42,
          "en": "So for that here, we can also store the summary",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 345.42,
          "end": 349.29,
          "en": "by getting hold of formData.get 'summary',",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 349.29,
          "end": 351.57,
          "en": "extracting the data from the input field",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 351.57,
          "end": 352.977,
          "en": "with the name \"summary\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 354,
          "end": 359,
          "en": "get the instructions from formData.get 'instructions',",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 360.45,
          "end": 365.45,
          "en": "and get the image from formData.get 'image'.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 365.85,
          "end": 368.73,
          "en": "Now, for this to work, we have to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 368.73,
          "end": 371.07,
          "en": "that we pass the appropriate name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 371.07,
          "end": 372.933,
          "en": "to our ImagePicker component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 373.83,
          "end": 376.26,
          "en": "And at the moment, I'm not doing that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 376.26,
          "end": 378.06,
          "en": "Indeed I'm using the ImagePicker",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 378.06,
          "end": 381.06,
          "en": "without setting either a label or a name,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 381.06,
          "end": 383.22,
          "en": "and I now wanna change this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 383.22,
          "end": 388.22,
          "en": "So here I'll set the label to \"Your image\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 388.77,
          "end": 391.413,
          "en": "and the name to \"image\", let's say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 393.03,
          "end": 396.3,
          "en": "And with that, we make sure that we can extract that image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 396.3,
          "end": 398.79,
          "en": "with help of formData.get.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 398.79,
          "end": 401.34000000000003,
          "en": "Now, that will then be the uploaded file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 401.34000000000003,
          "end": 403.89,
          "en": "and we'll handle the storage of that file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 403.89,
          "end": 404.913,
          "en": "a little bit later.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 406.92,
          "end": 410.58,
          "en": "Now, besides that, I'll also get the creator of that meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 410.58,
          "end": 413.76,
          "en": "by accessing formData.get 'name',",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 413.76,
          "end": 416.58,
          "en": "because I'm getting that name of the person",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 416.58,
          "end": 419.913,
          "en": "who created that meal from that name input field,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 420.99,
          "end": 423.63,
          "en": "so with a name of \"name\",",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
